<title>USA: Key Energy names Francis John chairman.</title>
<headline>Key Energy names Francis John chairman.</headline>
<dateline>EAST BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Key Energy Group Inc said Thursday that its president and chief executive, Francis John, has been appointed to the added post of chairman of the board.</p>
<p>John succeeds Co-Chairmen Morton Wolkowitz and Van Greenfield, who will remain directors and executive board members with the energy company, said company spokeswoman Diane Mack.</p>
